.nh
.TH skopeo-manifest-digest(1)
.SH "نام (NAME)"
skopeo-manifest-digest \- Compute a manifest digest for a manifest-file and write it to standard output.

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBskopeo manifest-digest\fP \fImanifest-file\fP

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Compute a manifest digest of \fImanifest-file\fP and write it to standard output.

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB--help\fP, \fB-h\fP

.PP
Print usage statement

.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.EX
$ skopeo manifest-digest manifest.json
sha256:a59906e33509d14c036c8678d687bd4eec81ed7c4b8ce907b888c607f6a1e0e6
.EE

.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
skopeo(1)

